     "name": "unit 12",
     "number": 12,
     "folder": "Level 5/unit 12",
     "md": "Level 5/unit 12/unit 12.md",
     "mdText": "[HEADER] unit 12 — CD3\n\n[1] Conversation — track 22, 24, 25\nHokuto is on vacation. He's talking to Emily on the phone.\nEmily: How was the walking tour yesterday?\nHokuto: Great. We **had** a really good time.\nEmily: That's good. Was it tiring?\nHokuto: Yeah. It was a long, hot day. We came back to the hotel and I **took** a bath.\nEmily: What did you do for dinner?\nHokuto: We **had** a barbecue on the beach.\nEmily: Well, it sounds like you're **having** fun.\nHokuto: Yeah, we are. I **got** a lot of souvenirs, too. I'll show you when we get home.\n\n[2] Speak Like a Native — track 23\n1. It was a long, hot day.\nsmooth: “It was a”\nstrong: “long”, “hot”, “day”\nTừ it was a đọc liền mạch. 3 từ long, hot, day đọc nhấn mạnh.\n\n2. What did you do for dinner?\nsmooth: “What did you do”, “for dinner”\nweak: “did you”, “for”\nstrong: “do”, “dinner”\nWhat did you do và for dinner được đọc từng cái liền mạch. Động từ do và danh từ dinner là content word nên cần nhấn mạnh.\n\n3. I got a lot of souvenirs, too.\nsmooth: “got a lot of”\nlinking: “got‿a”, “lot‿of”\nLấy 1 hơi và đọc liền mạch cụm từ got a lot of. Đặc biệt, got a và lot of nối vào với nhau thành 1 từ.\n\n[3] Study Notes\n\n[4] Grammar Focus\nhave + N\nHave có ý nghĩa là sở hữu, ăn, uống thứ gì đó. Danh từ đi sau have, ngoài đồ vật ra còn có thể là suy nghĩ, cảm giác, tính chất...\nWe [[had]] a good time at the party.\nMy brother [[has]] a bad cold.\n\ntake + N\nTake có ý nghĩa là lấy một thứ gì đó, thường mang nghĩa chủ động.\nYou should [[take]] the subway to get there.\nWhy don't you [[take]] a shower?\n\nget + N\nGet có ý nghĩa là nhận một thứ gì đó. Tùy vào tình huống, nó còn có nghĩa là mua một thứ gì đó.\nI [[got]] a ticket to the concert.\nI'm [[getting]] a haircut the day after tomorrow.\n\n[5] Role Play — track 27\nA: How was the walking tour yesterday?\nB: Great. We ________.\nA: That's good. Was it tiring?\nB: Yeah. It was a long, hot day. We came back to the hotel and I ________.\nA: What did you do for dinner?\nB: We had a barbecue on the beach.\nA: Well, it sounds like you're having fun.\nB: Yeah, we are. I ________, too. I'll show you when we get home.\n\n[6] Substitution Drill — track 28\n1. We __had a really good time__.\na. had a lot of fun\nb. got a lot of exercise\nc. took a lot of pictures\n\n2. We came back to the hotel and I __took a bath__.\na. got a massage\nb. took a nap\nc. took a shower\n\n3. I __got a lot of souvenirs__, too.\na. got some funny T-shirts\nb. got a suntan\nc. got a cool haircut\n",
